<title>POLAND: AGROS GROUP NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>AGROS GROUP NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Group net profit	     5.91 vs   3.60</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 4.36 vs   5.53</p>
<p> Group operating profit     6.35 vs   6.25</p>
<p> Group sales		  102.90 vs  84.80</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Group net profit	    30.68 vs  21.33</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	54.01 vs  35.70</p>
<p> Group operating profit    69.92 vs  43.35</p>
<p> Group sales		  805.16 vs 632.42</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish food trader and producer is</p>
<p>Agros Holding SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
